    </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 pr-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-xl leading-[29px] font-bold tracking-tight truncate\">앱인토스, 당신의 아이디어가 토스의 3,000만 유저에게 닿는 방법</h4>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-32 shrink-0 pr-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-[17px] leading-[27px] font-medium tracking-tight truncate block\">토스</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-[104px] shrink-0 text-right\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-[17px] leading-[27px] font-medium tracking-tight\">2025-07-25</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row items-center justify-start w-full gap-4 group cursor-pointer py-1\">\n        <div class=\"w-[92px] shrink-0\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-[17px] leading-[27px] font-medium tracking-tight\">보도자료</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 pr-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-xl leading-[29px] font-bold tracking-tight truncate\">토스페이먼츠, PG 업계 최초 통합 리스크 관리 시스템(RMS) 도입</h4>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-32 shrink-0 pr-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-[17px] leading-[27px] font-medium tracking-tight truncate block\">토스페이먼츠</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-[104px] shrink-0 text-right\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-[17px] leading-[27px] font-medium tracking-tight\">2025-07-23</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row items-center justify-start w-full gap-4 group cursor-pointer py-1\">\n        <div class=\"w-[92px] shrink-0\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-[17px] leading-[27px] font-medium tracking-tight\">보도자료</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 pr-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-xl leading-[29px] font-bold tracking-tight truncate\">토스, 앱인토스 첫 웨비나 개최…관심 있는 누구나 참여 가능</h4>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-32 shrink-0 pr-4 text-left\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-[17px] leading-[27px] font-medium tracking-tight truncate block\">토스</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-[104px] shrink-0 text-right\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#333d4b] text-[17px] leading-[27px] font-medium tracking-tight\">2025-07-22</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Pagination -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-row items-center justify-start gap-1 w-full pt-2\">\n    <div class=\"w-[34px] h-[34px] rounded-full bg-[#f8f3e7] text-[#333d4b] font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-lg leading-none cursor-pointer\">\n      1\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-[34px] h-[34px] rounded-full text-[#6d7683] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center text-lg leading-none cursor-pointer\">\n      2\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-[34px] h-[34px] rounded-full text-[#6d7683] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center text-lg leading-none cursor-pointer\">\n      3\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-[34px] h-[34px] rounded-full text-[#6d7683] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center text-lg leading-none cursor-pointer\">\n      4\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-[34px] h-[34px] rounded-full text-[#6d7683] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center text-lg leading-none cursor-pointer\">\n      5\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
